## 💡 Tips for using this

- **Don't paste all phases at once.** Send the system prompt, wait for the agent's confirmation, then send Phase 1 only.
- After each phase's deliverable, actually run it before saying "continue" — that's the whole point of doing this progressively.
- If a phase feels too big when you see the output, tell the agent "split this into smaller steps" — it's built into the system prompt that it should do this, but remind it if it doesn't.
- Keep a running "known limitations" list as you go (Phase 8 collects these) — professors like seeing you're aware of what you simplified and why.
